  characterName: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f58d74a7082df9c4bbf8c68d7e8968e9, type: 2}
  text: 'There are many things you can interact with in the game: items, doors, chests,
    NPCs, enemies, etc.  Some interactions such as items can be interacted with by
    hovering over the item and clicking.  This will add the item to your inventory. 
    Other interactions will require the "up" button to be pressed while the lead
    party member is near the object, such as doors.'
